<text><body>
<div type="detail"><p>Bourke Place (or Lane) ran between Bourke and Little Bourke Streets just east of King Street. By the early 1990s, the lane was subsumed within the Bourke Place development at 600 Bourke Street. Bourke Place is the fourth tallest skyscraper in Melbourne.</p></div>
